    "name": "Mimi the Cat - Meow Together",
    "steam_appid": 2509700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/942bc551e5d614f1ecad042b498f7b50.avif?t=1751833963\" /></span><i>Mimi the Cat \u2013 Meow Together</i> is a sokoban-style game that offers the option to play solo or local cooperative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the situation by pushing boxes, stacking them, and even jumping between platforms, acquiring the best strategy to help the adorable kittens reach one of the available beds for a well-deserved rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Mimi the Cat \u2013 Meow Together</i>, you have two ways to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooperative Mode:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, you and your friend will take control of different kittens. Teamwork is essential to solve the puzzles, and cooperation is the key here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/c0d4aa2cfcf72b66e834fc6fa9d1c41c.poster.avif?t=1751833963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/c0d4aa2cfcf72b66e834fc6fa9d1c41c.webm?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/c0d4aa2cfcf72b66e834fc6fa9d1c41c.mp4?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player Mode:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In single player mode, the player will need to switch between the available cats, solving the puzzles alone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/4a85391b4a43c9e6f8a05abde9bea031.poster.avif?t=1751833963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/4a85391b4a43c9e6f8a05abde9bea031.webm?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/4a85391b4a43c9e6f8a05abde9bea031.mp4?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy and cooperation are crucial for success, but some toys in the environment can help solve the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/7c5396f5d12684d186929539e229e3c0.poster.avif?t=1751833963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/7c5396f5d12684d186929539e229e3c0.webm?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/7c5396f5d12684d186929539e229e3c0.mp4?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, you'll come across items. Collecting them provides possibilities; customize the kittens, making them even cuter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/471a319bd8fb8bacaf922d62199d8d77.poster.avif?t=1751833963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/471a319bd8fb8bacaf922d62199d8d77.webm?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/471a319bd8fb8bacaf922d62199d8d77.mp4?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no time limit or resources to manage, so you can calmly focus on solving the challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 handcrafted levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local cooperative or single player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Uniques outfits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 cute kittens.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/a008c24a5209544a4624c78d3f8e99f4.poster.avif?t=1751833963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/a008c24a5209544a4624c78d3f8e99f4.webm?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/a008c24a5209544a4624c78d3f8e99f4.mp4?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack boxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between platforms, like a good cat would.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist interface and gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restart level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tip on how many boxes are needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and sweet sokoban with relaxing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mimi, Branquinho, Nevezinho, Melzinha, Thomas, Nhoque, Pipoca, Cinzendo, Negan, are here to warm your heart \u2665.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/942bc551e5d614f1ecad042b498f7b50.avif?t=1751833963\" /></span><i>Mimi the Cat \u2013 Meow Together</i> is a sokoban-style game that offers the option to play solo or local cooperative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the situation by pushing boxes, stacking them, and even jumping between platforms, acquiring the best strategy to help the adorable kittens reach one of the available beds for a well-deserved rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Mimi the Cat \u2013 Meow Together</i>, you have two ways to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooperative Mode:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, you and your friend will take control of different kittens. Teamwork is essential to solve the puzzles, and cooperation is the key here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/c0d4aa2cfcf72b66e834fc6fa9d1c41c.poster.avif?t=1751833963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/c0d4aa2cfcf72b66e834fc6fa9d1c41c.webm?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/c0d4aa2cfcf72b66e834fc6fa9d1c41c.mp4?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player Mode:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In single player mode, the player will need to switch between the available cats, solving the puzzles alone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/4a85391b4a43c9e6f8a05abde9bea031.poster.avif?t=1751833963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/4a85391b4a43c9e6f8a05abde9bea031.webm?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/4a85391b4a43c9e6f8a05abde9bea031.mp4?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy and cooperation are crucial for success, but some toys in the environment can help solve the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/7c5396f5d12684d186929539e229e3c0.poster.avif?t=1751833963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/7c5396f5d12684d186929539e229e3c0.webm?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/7c5396f5d12684d186929539e229e3c0.mp4?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, you'll come across items. Collecting them provides possibilities; customize the kittens, making them even cuter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/471a319bd8fb8bacaf922d62199d8d77.poster.avif?t=1751833963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/471a319bd8fb8bacaf922d62199d8d77.webm?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/471a319bd8fb8bacaf922d62199d8d77.mp4?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no time limit or resources to manage, so you can calmly focus on solving the challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 handcrafted levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local cooperative or single player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Uniques outfits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 cute kittens.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/a008c24a5209544a4624c78d3f8e99f4.poster.avif?t=1751833963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/a008c24a5209544a4624c78d3f8e99f4.webm?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509700/extras/a008c24a5209544a4624c78d3f8e99f4.mp4?t=1751833963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack boxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between platforms, like a good cat would.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist interface and gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restart level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tip on how many boxes are needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and sweet sokoban with relaxing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mimi, Branquinho, Nevezinho, Melzinha, Thomas, Nhoque, Pipoca, Cinzendo, Negan, are here to warm your heart \u2665.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Mimi the Cat - Meow Together is a sokoban-style game that can be played solo or locally in cooperative mode. Create strategies by pushing, stacking, and jumping long distances so that the kittens reach their cozy beds and rest.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian",
    "reviews": "\u201c&quot;Mimi and Friends: Meow Together is a fun little game and very enjoyable as a co-op experience. It does have some small imperfections but also offers satisfying conundrums, a pleasant aesthetic, cute cats and delightful sound design.&quot;\u201d<br>\ud83d\ude3b \u2013 Indie Hive<br><br>\u201c&quot;Mimi the Cat \u2013 Meow Together adds a second cat, trains, outfits, and co-op. The trains are a new item that forces the two cats in the puzzle to work together to both get to their beds. You can play either solo or two-player on the same keyboard.&quot;\u201d<br>\ud83d\ude3b \u2013 Ladies Gamers<br>",
